Package: simitall
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Genome, Multi-Omics, Population, and Breeding Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Nirwan",
      family = "Tandukar",
      email = "tandukar.nirwan@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: An R-first interface for coordinated genome, genome annotation,
    sequencing-read, hybrid-assembly, genome-wide association study,
    phenotype, bulk and single-cell RNA-sequencing, cell-type expression
    quantitative trait locus, population-genetic, and breeding simulations,
    plus mixed-model association analysis, genomic prediction, parent
    selection, and crossing-plan design. The package produces
    explicit truth sets and interoperable FASTA, FASTQ, VCF, GFF3, BED, TSV,
    and JSON outputs. External simulators and assemblers are orchestrated from
    R, while population evolution can be delegated to SimuPOP through
    'reticulate'.
